# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# API-Versionen & Endpunkte (Referenz)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Chat Completions:     /openai/deployments/{name}/chat/completions?api-version=2024-06-01
# Realtime Token:       /openai/v1/realtime/client_secrets (POST, GA)
# WebRTC SDP:           /openai/v1/realtime/calls (POST, GA)
# Embeddings:           /openai/deployments/{name}/embeddings?api-version=2024-06-01
# DALL-E:               /openai/deployments/{name}/images/generations?api-version=2024-06-01
# FLUX:                 https://aiplaygroundaifoundry.openai.azure.com (serverless)
# Whisper:              /openai/deployments/{name}/audio/transcriptions?api-version=2024-06-01
# TTS:                  /openai/deployments/{name}/audio/speech?api-version=2024-06-01
# Claude:               https://aiplaygroundaifoundry.services.ai.azure.com/anthropic/v1/messages
# AI Foundry Serverless: https://{name}.swedencentral.models.ai.azure.com/v1/chat/completions
# Document Intelligence: https://westeurope.api.cognitive.microsoft.com/formrecognizer/
